// Syncthing ignore list for the DTU repo.
//
// THE RULE: git owns the text, Syncthing owns the binaries.
//
// This is deliberately a DENY-list. Everything listed here is skipped; anything
// NOT listed syncs. That is the opposite of the old drive-sync manifest, which
// was an allow-list of "large" extensions -- and which silently dropped every
// file type nobody had remembered to add (that is how the .slx Simulink models
// and the learn-sync .jpg photos ended up on one machine only).
//
// So: a new binary format starts syncing the day it appears. Only text that git
// already carries has to be listed below.
//
// Keep this in sync with .gitignore's "Large files" block when that changes.

// --- never sync: repo plumbing and caches ---------------------------------
.git
.stversions
.stignore
.history
__pycache__
node_modules
.venv
venv
.obsidian
.claude
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.swp
*.swo
*~
~*.lck

// --- never sync: prose and source that git tracks -------------------------
*.md
*.txt
*.csv
*.json
*.yml
*.yaml
*.ini
*.cfg
*.toml
*.xml
*.info
*.dict
*.example
*.supp
*.expected

// code
*.py
*.pyc
*.c
*.h
*.cpp
*.hpp
*.ino
*.js
*.cjs
*.mjs
*.ts
*.css
*.html
*.rb
*.sh
*.bat
*.ps1
*.cmake
*.tcl
*.jar

// MATLAB / Maple / SPICE / HDL sources (text)
*.m
*.asv
*.cir
*.net
*.asc
*.vhd
*.vhdl
*.v
*.sv
*.xdc
*.qsch
*.kicad_sch
*.kicad_pcb
*.kicad_pro
*.kicad_prl
*.kicad_sym
*.kicad_mod

// LaTeX sources and build droppings
*.tex
*.cls
*.sty
*.bib
*.aux
*.toc
*.fls
*.log
*.out
*.synctex
*.synctex.gz
*.fdb_latexmk
latexmkrc
*.latexmkrc

// build artefacts
*.o
*.exe
*.db

// --- never sync: files git owns that carry no extension -------------------
// The extension deny-list above cannot see these, and .gitignore/.gitattributes
// in particular describe repo state -- two machines on different commits must
// not push them at each other behind git's back.
.gitkeep
.gitignore
.gitattributes
.gitmodules
.gitconfig
.dockerignore
.npmignore
.editorconfig
.nvmrc
.python-version
LICENSE
LICENSE.*
COPYING
README
CHANGELOG
Makefile
makefile
GNUmakefile
Dockerfile
Dockerfile.*
latexmkrc
*.in

// --- never sync: images git already carries -------------------------------
// These are small, tracked, and arrive with a git pull. Leaving them to git
// avoids two systems writing the same file.
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.heic
*.svg
*.gif
*.ico

// --- everything else syncs ------------------------------------------------
// In practice that means: pdf pptx ppt docx doc xlsx dotx zip 7z rar tar.gz iso
// mov mp4 avi mkv wav mp3 mw mlx slx mat npz raw wbk step stl -- plus whatever
// new binary format a course throws at you next semester.
